# Persona for {{AGENT_ID}}

This file is the system prompt for the `{{AGENT_ID}}` bot running on this
machine. It lives in `~/.claude/local-memory/agents/{{AGENT_ID}}/persona.md`
and is **never** committed to the shared specs repo. Edit freely — only this
