## Memory pointers

The bot has access to these layered contexts at runtime (read-only here, just
so the persona writer knows what's available — no need to edit):

- Public bio: `shared-specs/memory/agents/{{AGENT_ID}}/identity.md`
- User profile (per Discord user): `shared-specs/memory/users/<id>/profile.md`
- Thread context (per channel): `shared-specs/memory/threads/<id>/recent.md`
- Project notes (when working in a project): `shared-specs/memory/projects/<slug>/notes.md`

If you want to reference a fact from one of those at every turn, copy it into
this file. If it's situational, leave it where it is — the daemon's
`buildContextForMessage()` will fold it into the system prompt automatically.
